OL,3,C'Reckless' driver swerves between
OL,4,Clanes on M6 before crash
OL,6,FA "reckless and dangerous" driver
OL,7,Ftravelling at high speed and swerving
OL,8,Fbetween lanes on the M6 crashed into a
OL,9,Florry.
OL,11,FIdeel Shad appeared at Chester Crown
OL,12,FCourt on 11 August after pleading
OL,13,Fguilty to dangerous driving and
OL,14,Fdriving without insurance at an
OL,15,Fearlier hearing.
OL,17,FThe 22-year-old, from Brierley Hill in
OL,18,Fthe West Midlands, was sentenced to 10
OL,19,Fmonths in prison, suspended for 12
OL,20,Fmonths.
OL,26,@nD@COUnD@ZO]
