OL,3,C'Reckless' driver swerves between
OL,4,Clanes on M6 before crash
OL,6,FAt around 1.10pm on Friday 5 June, an
OL,7,Fofficer attempted to stop Shad, who
OL,8,Fwas driving a white BMW 4 Series on
OL,9,Fthe M6 northbound.
OL,11,FThe officer moved in front of the
OL,12,Fvehicle, but Shad swerved back onto
OL,13,Fthe main carriageway and sped away,
OL,14,Fweaving between lanes.
OL,16,FThe officer followed, but due to the
OL,17,FBMW's speed and the manner of driving
OL,18,Fin busy traffic, they lost sight of
OL,19,Fthe vehicle.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/4
