OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786724321
OL,3,C'Reckless' driver swerves between
OL,4,Clanes on M6 before crash
OL,6,FAs the officer approached junction 20,
OL,7,Fthey saw the BMW had been involved in
OL,8,Fa collision with a lorry.
OL,10,FShad was still standing next to the
OL,11,Fcar when officers arrived and was
OL,12,Farrested on suspicion of several
OL,13,Foffences, including dangerous driving
OL,14,Fand driving without insurance.
OL,16,FIn response, Shad said: "Do you see
OL,17,Fwhy I didn't stop now?"
OL,26,@xD@YOUyD@WO]
