OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786724321
OL,3,C'Reckless' driver swerves between
OL,4,Clanes on M6 before crash
OL,6,FSergeant Andy Brett, from the Roads
OL,7,Fand Crime Unit, said Shad's driving
OL,8,Fhad put both himself and other road
OL,9,Fusers at risk.
OL,11,FHe said: "Shad's driving was reckless
OL,12,Fand dangerous. He put other road users
OL,13,Fand himself in harm's way, the
OL,14,Fconsequences of which don't bear
OL,15,Fthinking about.
OL,17,F"To drive like that in busy traffic
OL,18,Fwas idiotic and has resulted in this
OL,19,Fconviction. I hope he now realises
OL,20,Fthat illegal actions have
OL,21,Fconsequences."
OL,26,@sD@JOUyD@AOU}D@NO]
